@startuml get-manager-business-card
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/business-card
caption CRB-44 · 현업자 명함 현황 목록 (최근 인증 순). 명함 파일에 접근하지 않아 열람 기록을 남기지 않음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "BusinessCardController" as Controller
participant "BusinessCardService" as Service
participant "AdminGraduatedRepository" as AdminGraduatedRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/business-card?page=&size=\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (page < 1, size < 1 또는 > 50, 정수가 아님)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
note right of Pipe: 기본값 page = 1, size = 20
Pipe -> Controller: list(query)
Controller -> Service: list(query)

par 동시에 조회 — 같은 조건
  Service -> AdminGraduatedRepository: findPage(offset, limit)
  AdminGraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT g.pk, g.verified_at, business_card_key IS NOT NULL,\nu.status, u.withdraw_requested_at, u.name,\ngp.nickname, gp.company, gp.job\nFROM graduated g JOIN users u\nLEFT JOIN graduated_profile gp\nWHERE u.is_deleted = false\nORDER BY g.verified_at DESC NULLS LAST, g.pk LIMIT OFFSET
  note right
    탈퇴 처리가 끝난 현업자는 명함과 이름이 지워져 관리할 것이 없어 뺌.
    business_card_key 값은 내려주지 않고 있는지만 봄.
    가입 중(프로필 없음)이면 nickname · company · job은 null
  end note
  AdminGraduatedRepository --> Service: rows
else
  Service -> AdminGraduatedRepository: (count)
  AdminGraduatedRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 FROM · WHERE)
  AdminGraduatedRepository --> Service: total
end

Service -> Service: signup_status 계산\nwithdraw_requested_at 있음 → "withdrawal_requested"\n그 외 → users.status (pending | active)
Service --> Controller: { items, page, size, total }
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: BusinessCardGraduatedDto[], page, size, total }\nitem = { graduated_pk, name, nickname, company, job,\nhas_business_card, verified_at, signup_status }

@enduml
